11. "with, 'Maybe, but ain't no sure'" should be "with, 'Maybe, but I'm not sure'" (correct use of "I'm not" instead of "ain't").
12. "and he not heard me" should be "and he didn't hear me" (correct use of "didn't" for negation).
13. "'What?' he asks" should be "'What?' he asked" (consistent verb tense).
14. "'Did you found it?'" should be "'Did you find it?'" (correct verb form).

