This solution works by recursively traversing the tree. If the current node is one of the target nodes, it returns the current node. It then checks the left and right subtrees. If both subtrees return a non-`None` value, it means the current node is the HCA, so it returns the current node. Otherwise, it propagates the non-`None` value from the subtrees.

