2. Compare the elements at the two pointers and add the smaller one to the merged array.
3. Move the pointer of the array with the smaller element one step forward.
4. Repeat steps 2-3 until one of the arrays is exhausted.
5. If one array is exhausted, append the remaining elements of the other array to the merged array.
